    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">以一個動作，你可以高舉這張卡片，召喚一顆熊熊燃燒的隕石落到距你120尺內的可見地點。以那個點爲中心，半徑20尺範圍內的每個生物都必須進行一次DC 17的敏捷豁免。豁免失敗的生物會受到6d6點鈍擊傷害和6d6點火焰傷害，豁免成功只受一半傷害。這一特性一經使用，直到次日黎明之前無法再次使用。</span></p><p>As an action, you can hold this card aloft and call down a fiery meteor to a point you can see within 120 feet of yourself. Each creature within a 20-foot-radius sphere centered on that point must make a [[/save ability=dex dc=17]] saving throw. On a failed save, a creature takes [[/damage 6d6 type=bludgeoning]] damage and [[/damage 6d6 type=fire]] damage, or half as much damage on a successful save. Once this property is used, it can't be used again until the next dawn.</p></div>",
